WEBVTT

01:38.250 --> 01:41.070
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.110 --> 01:44.030
[Episode 18]

01:46.759 --> 01:47.430
Xuanye,

01:48.710 --> 01:49.590
six years ago,

01:50.280 --> 01:52.140
misfortunes befell your family.

01:52.400 --> 01:53.509
I went to Guangping

01:54.200 --> 01:55.640
to arrange your family affairs

01:55.640 --> 01:57.170
because you were in prison.

01:57.920 --> 01:59.310
Your father's matter was widely known,

01:59.310 --> 02:00.760
so things weren't easy for me.

02:00.760 --> 02:01.350
I had

02:01.760 --> 02:02.760
to go to Shendu

02:02.950 --> 02:05.210
where I finally made the problem go away.

02:05.400 --> 02:06.200
When I returned to Guangping,

02:06.200 --> 02:07.530
I tried to meet with you,

02:07.790 --> 02:09.190
but you had already left.

02:10.630 --> 02:12.310
I was so distraught

02:12.430 --> 02:13.910
that I went traveling around.

02:13.910 --> 02:16.840
I didn't go back to Guangping until six months later.

02:18.750 --> 02:19.470
Thanks to you,

02:19.470 --> 02:20.710
I didn't lose my life

02:20.800 --> 02:21.840
years ago.

02:22.870 --> 02:23.910
I've always wanted to

02:23.910 --> 02:25.040
thank you in person,

02:25.240 --> 02:26.079
but I could never find

02:26.079 --> 02:28.030
your abode after a long time of searching.

02:28.030 --> 02:30.150
It's a real surprise that we could meet up today.

02:30.150 --> 02:30.910
How lucky.

02:32.560 --> 02:33.020
Xuanye,

02:34.240 --> 02:35.700
you're like a nephew to me.

02:35.960 --> 02:37.620
Let's forgo the formalities.

02:38.280 --> 02:39.120
In fact,

02:39.360 --> 02:40.490
I owe more gratitude

02:41.520 --> 02:43.400
to your father than you do me.

02:43.560 --> 02:45.030
I heard from my father

02:45.430 --> 02:46.890
that a junior fellow of his

02:47.030 --> 02:48.100
was exceptionally gifted

02:48.100 --> 02:49.560
and amazingly brilliant.

02:49.910 --> 02:51.910
But since this person was expelled,

02:52.240 --> 02:53.290
they had never met up again.

02:53.290 --> 02:53.890
Yes.

02:56.960 --> 02:58.420
We were so young back then.

02:58.520 --> 02:59.590
We thought we'd have many chances

02:59.590 --> 03:00.190
to meet up.

03:01.360 --> 03:02.490
Neither did we think

03:03.630 --> 03:05.160
we would be forever parted.

03:05.240 --> 03:05.750
Why

03:05.750 --> 03:07.800
were you expelled from the sect?

03:12.520 --> 03:13.190
Because of

03:14.080 --> 03:15.080
idea collisions.

03:15.470 --> 03:17.910
I left the mountain for adventures at 20.

03:18.560 --> 03:19.420
In Nanguo Town,

03:20.030 --> 03:21.120
I met a woman,

03:22.120 --> 03:23.150
who I hopelessly fell in love with

03:23.150 --> 03:24.120
at first sight.

03:25.190 --> 03:26.310
She also liked me.

03:27.340 --> 03:28.840
We promised to spend the rest

03:28.840 --> 03:30.100
of our lives together.

03:31.590 --> 03:32.870
But soon I found out

03:34.000 --> 03:35.329
that she was not a human,

03:36.640 --> 03:37.960
but a fox demon.

03:41.240 --> 03:42.770
I struggled for a long time,

03:42.829 --> 03:44.490
but I just couldn't leave her.

03:45.560 --> 03:46.400
However,

03:47.520 --> 03:49.650
as a disciple of the Eight Pillar Sect.

03:49.870 --> 03:51.520
I had to follow its strict rules.

03:51.520 --> 03:52.250
The first one

03:52.590 --> 03:53.990
is to stay clear of demons

03:54.079 --> 03:56.290
and to never get emotionally attached to them.

03:56.290 --> 03:57.560
When my master found out about us,

03:57.560 --> 03:58.400
he got furious

03:58.960 --> 03:59.579
and demanded me

03:59.579 --> 04:01.280
to instantly sever ties with her.

04:01.280 --> 04:02.280
But at that time,

04:02.750 --> 04:04.080
how could I bring myself to do it?

04:04.080 --> 04:04.750
Therefore,

04:05.210 --> 04:06.110
I had to bid farewell to

04:06.110 --> 04:07.750
my master and the senior fellows,

04:07.750 --> 04:09.280
and leave the sect forever,

04:09.840 --> 04:12.360
so as to be with that woman.

04:15.190 --> 04:16.320
What happened then?

04:16.630 --> 04:18.089
Are you still with her now?

04:21.269 --> 04:22.040
No.

04:22.360 --> 04:23.120
Why?

04:23.830 --> 04:24.630
She left.

04:24.950 --> 04:25.560
Left?

04:27.440 --> 04:29.240
Although she was in love with me,

04:29.390 --> 04:31.590
she couldn't defy the nature of a demon.

04:31.670 --> 04:32.870
One time, when she got drunk,

04:32.870 --> 04:34.200
and her mind was confused,

04:34.200 --> 04:35.600
she lost control of herself

04:35.600 --> 04:36.800
and almost maimed me.

04:37.100 --> 04:37.990
After that,

04:38.600 --> 04:39.430
she left.

04:41.020 --> 04:42.430
Didn't you go look for her?

04:42.430 --> 04:43.120
I did,

04:44.680 --> 04:46.010
but I couldn't find her.

04:47.390 --> 04:48.240
So,

04:48.510 --> 04:50.070
I came to the Underground City.

04:50.070 --> 04:51.510
Humans and demons mingle here.

04:51.510 --> 04:53.170
There are all sorts of demons.

04:53.510 --> 04:53.930
I thought

04:53.930 --> 04:55.330
we would reunite one day.

04:55.830 --> 04:57.430
Sadly, 20 years have passed,

04:58.270 --> 04:59.730
yet she has never shown up.

05:02.480 --> 05:03.740
How could this happen?

05:06.990 --> 05:09.850
Well, humans and demons are inherently different.

05:12.750 --> 05:14.720
Compared with other unfortunate couples,

05:14.720 --> 05:16.180
she and I were quite lucky.

05:17.630 --> 05:19.430
Hasn't there been an exception?

05:21.040 --> 05:21.970
Maybe there has,

05:23.600 --> 05:25.260
but I just don't know about it.

05:29.950 --> 05:30.680
Uncle,

05:32.270 --> 05:33.830
why did you ask me

05:33.950 --> 05:35.000
for a meeting?

05:35.390 --> 05:35.990
No reason.

05:37.430 --> 05:38.590
I was just wondering

05:39.240 --> 05:41.570
what you came to the Underground City for.

05:45.000 --> 05:47.060
Why do you want to visit this gallery?

05:47.630 --> 05:50.270
Lord Xin'an is an expert in calligraphy and paintings.

05:50.270 --> 05:50.750
When he

05:50.770 --> 05:52.090
travels to a new place,

05:52.630 --> 05:53.680
he'd visit the local galleries

05:53.680 --> 05:54.640
for pleasure.

05:55.310 --> 05:55.950
We're out

05:55.950 --> 05:56.920
of leads anyway.

05:58.270 --> 05:59.800
Might as well take a chance.

06:00.630 --> 06:02.870
Which direction should we head towards?

06:02.870 --> 06:04.120
Well...

06:04.530 --> 06:04.970
Hello.

06:05.960 --> 06:07.680
[Mr. Pu]

06:06.390 --> 06:07.990
Are you looking for someone?

06:08.800 --> 06:09.600
No, we're not.

06:12.720 --> 06:13.680
How do you know

06:13.680 --> 06:15.210
we are looking for someone?

06:16.800 --> 06:17.720
I

06:17.720 --> 06:19.250
observed the stars at night

06:19.800 --> 06:21.330
and performed divination.

06:21.430 --> 06:22.720
Then I just figured it all out.

06:22.720 --> 06:24.180
One can't see the sky here.

06:24.360 --> 06:25.820
How did you observe stars?

06:26.600 --> 06:28.330
Young man, don't be so serious.

06:28.830 --> 06:30.390
Or it'll be hard for you to find a wife.

06:30.390 --> 06:32.320
I'm not in the market for a wife now.

06:33.600 --> 06:35.930
It doesn't matter how I got to know your purpose.

06:35.930 --> 06:36.990
The important thing is,

06:36.990 --> 06:39.950
I can help you find the person you want to meet with.

06:42.510 --> 06:43.190
How?

06:48.270 --> 06:51.070
This is called the Miraculous Navigator.

06:54.190 --> 06:54.720
It...

06:55.710 --> 06:57.170
Isn't this just a compass?

06:58.000 --> 06:58.480
Well,

06:58.800 --> 07:00.160
it does look like

07:00.180 --> 07:01.350
a regular compass,

07:01.430 --> 07:03.510
but it doesn't function the same.

07:04.430 --> 07:05.080
Compasses

07:05.670 --> 07:06.550
show you where

07:07.040 --> 07:08.220
the south and north are.

07:08.220 --> 07:09.950
But this Miraculous Navigator

07:10.000 --> 07:10.990
can tell you

07:11.480 --> 07:13.750
where the person you want to see is.

07:16.360 --> 07:17.000
Miss,

07:17.870 --> 07:19.000
take my words for it.

07:19.430 --> 07:20.790
Pray with your heart,

07:21.240 --> 07:22.370
and this precious item

07:22.370 --> 07:23.770
will definitely lead you

07:23.800 --> 07:25.920
to the person you're thinking about.

07:36.190 --> 07:38.430
Excuse me. Have you seen this person?

07:39.190 --> 07:40.120
No, I haven't.

07:41.310 --> 07:41.909
Thank you.

07:42.070 --> 07:42.600
It works well.

07:42.600 --> 07:43.659
It works very well.

07:45.600 --> 07:46.330
I'll take it.

07:50.590 --> 07:51.650
What a squanderer.

07:57.120 --> 07:57.750
You're

07:58.760 --> 08:00.700
looking for your parents then, aren't you?

08:00.700 --> 08:01.190
Yes.

08:02.630 --> 08:03.240
You're here

08:03.240 --> 08:04.440
to help her with that?

08:05.430 --> 08:05.830
Yes.

08:09.390 --> 08:10.790
And you're just friends?

08:15.510 --> 08:17.370
This matter is related to demons.

08:17.470 --> 08:18.670
She asked for my help.

08:18.800 --> 08:20.260
I couldn't say no, could I?

08:24.480 --> 08:25.070
Uncle,

08:25.950 --> 08:26.600
I have

08:27.060 --> 08:28.170
a favor to ask.

08:29.680 --> 08:30.190
I know.

08:31.190 --> 08:31.810
You're wondering

08:31.810 --> 08:32.940
if I can help you find

08:33.440 --> 08:35.270
the Enlightenment Bookstore, right?

08:35.270 --> 08:37.750
Yes. You're the owner of Xiaodongtian,

08:38.159 --> 08:40.510
and one of the leaders of the Underground City.

08:40.510 --> 08:41.510
You basically rule this place.

08:41.510 --> 08:43.110
You must be familiar with it.

08:43.390 --> 08:44.770
Your help

08:45.390 --> 08:46.810
will save us much trouble.

08:46.810 --> 08:47.480
Xuanye,

08:47.840 --> 08:49.170
don't try to flatter me.

08:49.870 --> 08:51.670
I wouldn't say I'm a leader here.

08:51.930 --> 08:52.600
When you stay here long enough,

08:52.600 --> 08:53.480
you'll know

08:54.000 --> 08:56.000
there are many dark secrets hidden.

08:56.240 --> 08:56.790
Even I would have to

08:56.790 --> 08:58.480
stay away from certain people.

08:58.480 --> 08:59.740
Nonetheless, Xuanye,

09:00.480 --> 09:01.410
I'll absolutely

09:01.670 --> 09:03.800
lend you a helping hand if you need one.

09:04.750 --> 09:05.480
Thank you.

09:06.480 --> 09:07.080
Chunmian,

09:09.120 --> 09:10.070
I need you to look for

09:10.070 --> 09:12.120
a shop called Enlightenment Bookstore.

09:12.120 --> 09:13.650
Let me know when you find it.

09:13.670 --> 09:14.030
Yes.

09:16.070 --> 09:16.930
Thank you, sir.

09:20.910 --> 09:21.670
Don't call me

09:21.670 --> 09:22.600
"sir" anymore.

09:23.360 --> 09:25.320
Just like him, you should call me

09:26.080 --> 09:26.750
"Uncle."

09:36.260 --> 09:37.320
Please enjoy.

09:37.510 --> 09:38.110
Thank you.

09:39.020 --> 09:41.020
Be careful, or you could get burned.

09:43.000 --> 09:43.790
Is it good?

09:47.340 --> 09:48.860
Over these few days,

09:49.330 --> 09:50.510
I've been so worried and scared

09:50.510 --> 09:52.510
that I couldn't enjoy a single meal.

09:55.440 --> 09:56.260
Have those demon hunters

09:56.260 --> 09:58.060
been leaving you alone in the inn

09:58.320 --> 09:59.720
after bringing you here?

10:01.120 --> 10:01.630
Yes.

10:02.460 --> 10:03.290
I told them

10:03.320 --> 10:04.440
I wanted to go out with them,

10:04.440 --> 10:05.840
but they wouldn't let me.

10:06.200 --> 10:06.790
Most importantly,

10:06.790 --> 10:07.750
they kept asking me about

10:07.750 --> 10:09.120
your and Chi Xue.

10:09.320 --> 10:11.270
After I told them I was not that close with you,

10:11.270 --> 10:13.730
they took a completely different attitude.

10:14.080 --> 10:15.200
They've never stopped spending my money

10:15.200 --> 10:16.130
and trade notes.

10:18.390 --> 10:19.190
Didn't you say

10:19.670 --> 10:20.440
you guys

10:20.440 --> 10:22.300
actually got along well, despite

10:22.620 --> 10:24.150
a minor misunderstanding?

10:27.750 --> 10:28.960
What a small portion of food.

10:28.960 --> 10:30.960
That can't be enough for you, right?

10:31.120 --> 10:32.110
I'll buy you some more food

10:32.110 --> 10:32.840
over there.

10:38.910 --> 10:39.390
Sir,

10:39.670 --> 10:41.130
a bowl of wontons, please.

10:41.240 --> 10:41.670
Okay.

11:31.250 --> 11:32.000
Here you are.

11:32.690 --> 11:33.750
I don't want it now.

11:34.440 --> 11:34.910
But...

11:36.750 --> 11:37.750
She already left.

11:38.310 --> 11:39.310
It's alright now.

11:46.630 --> 11:48.820
[Wugeng Inn]

11:54.200 --> 11:55.000
Good morning.

11:56.320 --> 11:58.050
My master has a message for you.

11:58.390 --> 11:59.590
We've found out where

11:59.670 --> 12:01.530
the Enlightenment Bookstore is.

12:07.460 --> 12:09.620
[Enlightenment Bookstore]

12:15.360 --> 12:16.360
Take a look.

12:16.390 --> 12:17.600
Fine porcelain.

12:17.600 --> 12:18.790
Come have a look!

12:19.840 --> 12:20.270
Hello!

12:20.840 --> 12:22.040
High-quality goods.

12:22.360 --> 12:23.200
Take a look.

12:25.030 --> 12:25.390
Miss,

12:25.390 --> 12:26.360
look at this side.

12:26.360 --> 12:27.030
Look at this one.

12:27.030 --> 12:27.830
No, thank you.

12:27.960 --> 12:28.600
I'm good.

12:29.630 --> 12:30.490
Goodbye, miss.

12:30.750 --> 12:31.410
Greetings.

12:31.600 --> 12:32.750
I've got some great products here.

12:32.750 --> 12:33.480
Look at them.

12:35.590 --> 12:37.670
[Enlightenment]

12:36.250 --> 12:37.110
Herbs.

12:38.550 --> 12:39.510
Do you need herbs?

12:39.510 --> 12:40.000
Banxia,

12:41.210 --> 12:42.210
this is the place.

12:44.070 --> 12:45.310
So covert, isn't it?

12:46.080 --> 12:47.740
No wonder we couldn't find it.

12:48.960 --> 12:50.240
Lyu Chunmian told me about it.

12:50.240 --> 12:51.700
This shop is run by a demon.

12:51.870 --> 12:52.670
Demon?

12:54.000 --> 12:54.490
Yes.

12:55.240 --> 12:56.440
It's owned by a demon.

12:56.670 --> 12:57.930
Demons can open shops?

12:59.440 --> 13:00.500
In this place, yes.

13:00.990 --> 13:02.240
As long as they don't harm anyone

13:02.240 --> 13:03.400
or reveal their true forms,

13:03.400 --> 13:05.270
they can do business in a subtle way

13:05.270 --> 13:07.070
without others' interference.

13:07.960 --> 13:08.620
Chi Xue,

13:09.320 --> 13:10.520
no need to wait for us.

13:11.320 --> 13:11.840
Banxia,

13:12.120 --> 13:13.850
let's check out what's inside.

13:15.770 --> 13:16.630
Please come in.

13:25.960 --> 13:26.630
Are you

13:26.650 --> 13:28.050
shopping for paintings?

13:28.390 --> 13:29.910
We're just browsing around.

13:29.910 --> 13:30.350
Okay.

13:30.550 --> 13:32.280
Come on in and look around then.

13:47.620 --> 13:50.760
[A Spring Day in Guangping]

14:23.850 --> 14:25.470
Stop what you're doing!

14:29.540 --> 14:31.270
I am Sha Man,

14:29.990 --> 14:33.150
[Sha Man]

14:31.420 --> 14:33.030
the owner of the Enlightenment Bookstore.

14:33.030 --> 14:33.750
Are you here

14:33.840 --> 14:35.030
to buy paintings?

14:45.960 --> 14:46.510
Or are you

14:47.080 --> 14:49.150
here for an inspection?

14:49.390 --> 14:50.980
I... My place... Well...

14:51.600 --> 14:52.330
Come with me.

14:52.720 --> 14:53.520
Come, please.

14:53.690 --> 14:54.690
Just come with me.

15:05.480 --> 15:06.630
Look at these, please.

15:06.630 --> 15:07.330
This is

15:07.360 --> 15:08.750
the store's operation permit.

15:08.750 --> 15:09.670
Residence permit.

15:09.670 --> 15:10.440
Security declaration.

15:10.440 --> 15:12.000
Lease payment statements.

15:12.120 --> 15:12.910
And

15:12.910 --> 15:13.880
a certificate

15:13.910 --> 15:14.790
issued by Xiaodongtian,

15:14.790 --> 15:17.520
proving the store to be a high-quality business.

15:17.960 --> 15:18.840
You see,

15:19.030 --> 15:19.960
since this bookstore opened,

15:19.960 --> 15:21.270
we've been running it with integrity

15:21.270 --> 15:21.840
and diligence.

15:21.840 --> 15:22.750
We've never deceived

15:22.750 --> 15:23.320
a single customer,

15:23.320 --> 15:24.530
or allowed a fight or dispute

15:24.530 --> 15:25.770
to happen.

15:27.670 --> 15:28.670
To be honest,

15:29.590 --> 15:30.930
given my identity,

15:30.960 --> 15:32.270
it's already difficult

15:32.270 --> 15:34.110
for me to run a shop here.

15:34.750 --> 15:36.080
Every day, people look at me

15:36.080 --> 15:37.600
with discrimination.

15:37.920 --> 15:38.670
I'm often faced

15:38.670 --> 15:40.670
with official inquiries.

15:41.840 --> 15:43.390
Truth to be told,

15:43.600 --> 15:44.910
every day, I receive more

15:44.910 --> 15:46.840
inspectors than customers.

15:47.910 --> 15:49.770
We're not here for an inspection.

15:50.330 --> 15:51.550
Not for an inspection?

15:51.550 --> 15:53.010
Then what are you here for?

15:53.250 --> 15:54.780
We're looking for someone.

15:55.550 --> 15:56.750
Looking for someone?

15:57.390 --> 15:58.990
You should've led with that.

16:08.000 --> 16:09.510
We often draw portraits of missing persons.

16:09.510 --> 16:10.720
Part of our service, I'd say.

16:10.720 --> 16:12.250
The quality is guaranteed.

16:12.320 --> 16:13.030
Would you

16:13.030 --> 16:14.030
describe

16:14.030 --> 16:15.120
the person you're looking for

16:15.120 --> 16:15.840
to me?

16:15.840 --> 16:17.640
On the day he or she went missing,

16:22.840 --> 16:25.120
what was this person

16:25.150 --> 16:25.960
wearing?

16:26.730 --> 16:27.730
Don't bother.

16:28.080 --> 16:29.480
We've got a clue already.

16:29.800 --> 16:30.530
We just need

16:30.780 --> 16:32.310
some information from you.

16:34.140 --> 16:36.620
I don't go out much.

16:36.780 --> 16:37.600
Perhaps I'm not able

16:37.600 --> 16:38.750
to give you any information.

16:38.750 --> 16:39.870
But since you're already here,

16:39.870 --> 16:40.960
you can tell me what you want to know.

16:40.960 --> 16:41.720
Maybe

16:41.840 --> 16:42.810
I can be of

16:42.840 --> 16:43.870
some help to you.

16:46.440 --> 16:48.170
My mother's name is Tang Ruyun.

16:48.360 --> 16:50.020
She went missing 12 years ago.

16:52.320 --> 16:52.910
This is why

16:52.910 --> 16:53.670
I came to

16:53.670 --> 16:54.930
the Underground City.

16:57.250 --> 16:58.460
I see.

16:59.120 --> 17:00.720
I feel for you.

17:02.960 --> 17:05.359
Do you know anything about my parents?

17:05.720 --> 17:06.390
No.

17:08.030 --> 17:09.089
Then why are you...

17:09.480 --> 17:10.280
I'm just

17:10.480 --> 17:11.790
feeling sorry for you.

17:12.160 --> 17:13.770
Why would something

17:13.920 --> 17:14.710
that terrible

17:14.710 --> 17:16.579
happen to a nice girl?

17:18.400 --> 17:19.480
Although I can't

17:19.720 --> 17:20.760
be of much help,

17:21.200 --> 17:21.589
I still

17:21.589 --> 17:22.720
hope your trip

17:22.750 --> 17:24.609
to my bookstore can be rewarding.

17:25.750 --> 17:26.550
Would you

17:26.920 --> 17:27.720
show me

17:28.000 --> 17:28.880
that letter?

18:00.400 --> 18:01.500
Indeed...

18:02.430 --> 18:03.630
I do sell

18:03.880 --> 18:05.140
this type of rosin ink.

18:05.270 --> 18:05.960
However,

18:06.310 --> 18:07.870
tons of customers

18:07.890 --> 18:09.890
have bought such kind of ink.

18:09.920 --> 18:11.720
I can't give you a specific name.

18:13.000 --> 18:13.950
The seal

18:14.720 --> 18:17.240
seems to be from my shop too.

18:17.920 --> 18:18.650
Why don't you

18:18.960 --> 18:20.490
come with me and take a look?

18:27.400 --> 18:27.880
Here you are.

18:27.880 --> 18:29.810
See if one of these seals is of help.

18:34.990 --> 18:35.450
Well...

18:37.350 --> 18:38.110
So,

18:38.550 --> 18:40.280
neither do you know Tang Ruyun,

18:40.480 --> 18:42.680
or have seen this letter before, right?

18:46.070 --> 18:47.240
Is there any information

18:47.240 --> 18:48.100
you can tell us?

18:48.310 --> 18:49.640
I'm afraid no.

18:50.350 --> 18:51.100
That said,

18:51.240 --> 18:53.240
I can ask someone else about it.

18:53.680 --> 18:54.680
To be frank,

18:54.960 --> 18:56.000
I've been living in the Underground City

18:56.000 --> 18:57.200
for several decades.

18:57.270 --> 18:58.830
I've made many acquaintances.

18:58.830 --> 18:59.850
May I

18:59.880 --> 19:00.680
have

19:00.680 --> 19:02.590
your address?

19:02.680 --> 19:03.680
I'll let you know

19:04.000 --> 19:04.590
if I get

19:04.590 --> 19:05.720
any news.

19:07.030 --> 19:08.490
I'm staying at Wugeng Inn.

19:09.160 --> 19:11.220
Thank you so much for your help today.

19:11.640 --> 19:12.890
You're welcome.

19:13.610 --> 19:14.550
Come again if you need help.

19:14.550 --> 19:15.440
Even if you don't,

19:15.440 --> 19:17.110
you can still stop by to browse the paintings.

19:17.110 --> 19:18.370
Walk these guests out.

19:18.750 --> 19:19.310
Yes.

19:21.160 --> 19:21.720
This way,

19:22.350 --> 19:22.810
please.

19:34.680 --> 19:35.960
Did they leave?

19:36.750 --> 19:37.240
Yes.

19:38.440 --> 19:39.070
Really?

19:39.750 --> 19:40.240
Yes.

19:41.440 --> 19:42.850
Get me the hammer.

19:44.270 --> 19:44.750
Yes.

20:04.970 --> 20:06.160
Lift up your head.

20:10.920 --> 20:12.550
Are you blind?

20:13.550 --> 20:14.150
Master...

20:17.510 --> 20:19.200
Are you blind?

20:19.200 --> 20:21.640
Go to hell!

20:25.030 --> 20:25.980
One ran away.

20:26.300 --> 20:27.760
And this one is useless.

20:27.790 --> 20:29.270
I gotta paint a new one again!

20:29.270 --> 20:30.200
What a dud!

20:30.470 --> 20:31.270
I hate this.

20:31.480 --> 20:33.050
I hate this!

20:37.650 --> 20:39.590
Your mother has been missing for over 10 years.

20:39.590 --> 20:40.480
It's not that easy

20:40.480 --> 20:41.400
to find her.

20:42.200 --> 20:43.800
This is just a minor setback.

20:43.960 --> 20:45.360
Pull yourself together.

20:50.290 --> 20:50.740
Miss,

20:51.070 --> 20:51.770
I have

20:52.640 --> 20:53.510
a magical item

20:54.300 --> 20:56.730
named the Miraculous Navigator.

20:58.790 --> 20:59.400
Miss,

20:59.720 --> 21:00.750
just hold it

21:01.240 --> 21:02.170
and think about

21:02.750 --> 21:04.480
the person you most want to see.

21:04.640 --> 21:05.900
Then, it will point out

21:06.220 --> 21:08.090
a direction for you.

21:09.480 --> 21:10.940
Is it really that magical?

21:11.070 --> 21:12.000
It certainly is.

21:12.400 --> 21:12.960
Well,

21:13.110 --> 21:14.200
amicable lady,

21:15.200 --> 21:15.960
this won't

21:16.510 --> 21:17.570
cost you a fortune,

21:20.400 --> 21:23.330
but only a trade note that is worth 50 taels of silver.

21:25.640 --> 21:26.920
It's the Tracking Spell,

21:26.920 --> 21:28.310
the easiest magic technique.

21:28.310 --> 21:29.440
In Guangping,

21:29.510 --> 21:31.290
it's not even worth one tael of silver.

21:31.290 --> 21:32.760
One can easily learn it,

21:32.790 --> 21:34.190
but can hardly master it.

21:34.550 --> 21:35.680
Perhaps only one

21:35.820 --> 21:38.080
out of one thousand guesses is accurate.

21:40.240 --> 21:41.000
Come on, young man,

21:41.000 --> 21:42.530
why did you have to say that?

21:42.880 --> 21:45.440
Couldn't you just stay silent?

21:47.240 --> 21:47.960
You were selling this

21:47.960 --> 21:48.920
to my friend.

21:48.920 --> 21:50.920
Shouldn't I have kept her informed?

21:51.420 --> 21:53.480
A genuine heart often gets rewarded.

21:54.000 --> 21:54.720
Maybe

21:54.750 --> 21:56.150
this young lady is in luck

21:56.620 --> 21:58.240
to beat that one-in-a-thousand

21:58.240 --> 21:59.640
odd.

21:59.920 --> 22:00.310
Miss,

22:01.160 --> 22:02.720
buy it now. It really helps.

22:02.850 --> 22:04.480
You can find anyone you want with it.

22:04.480 --> 22:05.240
What is this?

22:07.440 --> 22:08.030
Miss,

22:08.200 --> 22:10.440
y-you have such a good eye!

22:10.830 --> 22:11.750
This is

22:12.000 --> 22:14.590
a Conch of Blue Tides from Penglai Island.

22:15.480 --> 22:16.200
It takes

22:16.590 --> 22:17.650
10 years to harvest

22:18.110 --> 22:18.770
such a conch

22:18.790 --> 22:20.200
on the entire island.

22:20.720 --> 22:22.780
If you are really interested in it...

22:33.160 --> 22:34.490
It's just an Echo Conch.

22:35.160 --> 22:36.310
When you speak to it,

22:36.970 --> 22:39.370
your voice can be preserved for a long time.

22:40.830 --> 22:41.680
How much is this?

22:41.680 --> 22:42.540
I want to buy it.

22:44.530 --> 22:45.660
You want to buy this?

22:52.320 --> 22:53.050
Here you are.

22:55.070 --> 22:56.670
This is too little, isn't it?

22:56.720 --> 22:57.180
This...

22:58.030 --> 22:59.490
More than enough, I'd say.

23:03.480 --> 23:05.140
Customers are hard to please.

23:06.080 --> 23:07.270
Why is it so difficult

23:07.270 --> 23:08.640
for me to run a business?

23:09.580 --> 23:10.310
Let's go.

23:23.270 --> 23:24.000
My Lady!

23:26.070 --> 23:26.720
My Lady.

23:27.350 --> 23:28.480
Where have you been?

23:30.000 --> 23:31.600
It's all Chi Xue's fault.

23:32.560 --> 23:33.840
This rabbit is Chi Xue?

23:35.270 --> 23:36.510
He's a lazybones.

23:36.830 --> 23:37.970
He dozed off after eating.

23:37.970 --> 23:39.300
He had me carry him home.

23:41.480 --> 23:43.240
Are you not afraid of him anymore?

23:43.240 --> 23:44.700
What's so scary about him?

23:45.440 --> 23:46.550
He's just a rabbit.

23:47.030 --> 23:48.200
A chubby rabbit.

23:48.800 --> 23:49.510
He's not much different

23:49.510 --> 23:50.780
from a regular rabbit.

23:57.310 --> 23:58.110
You pretended

23:58.720 --> 23:59.810
to be asleep, so Tingzhou

23:59.810 --> 24:01.010
had to carry you back.

24:01.200 --> 24:02.310
That was devious.

24:03.750 --> 24:05.750
I was just teasing her.

24:07.000 --> 24:08.830
There's a boundary between men and women in the mortal world.

24:08.830 --> 24:10.360
What you think of as teasing

24:10.680 --> 24:11.920
could be mistaken for flirting

24:11.920 --> 24:13.270
by others.

24:17.030 --> 24:17.480
What?

24:17.830 --> 24:19.000
Does it sound harsh to you?

24:19.000 --> 24:20.030
Yeah. It does.

24:20.870 --> 24:22.540
You can have fun with Banxia,

24:22.960 --> 24:23.750
but God forbid I should

24:23.750 --> 24:24.680
tease Tingzhou!

24:24.880 --> 24:25.880
Is that even fair?

24:26.310 --> 24:27.570
What nonsense is that?

24:29.070 --> 24:30.560
Just admit

24:30.590 --> 24:31.810
that you like Banxia.

24:32.030 --> 24:33.690
Make a decision, you wobbler.

24:33.920 --> 24:34.680
My Lady,

24:35.030 --> 24:36.110
rest assured.

24:36.410 --> 24:38.470
Physician Jiu definitely likes you.

24:39.330 --> 24:40.460
Isn't it obvious?

24:41.310 --> 24:43.270
He came after us right after we set out.

24:43.270 --> 24:44.310
You didn't pay him.

24:44.310 --> 24:46.240
Why would he help you for no reason?

24:46.440 --> 24:47.110
When

24:47.110 --> 24:48.510
your father is saved, you can ask him

24:48.510 --> 24:50.310
to cancel your engagement to Mr. Li.

24:50.310 --> 24:51.270
You've been a great daughter to him.

24:51.270 --> 24:52.750
I'm sure he'll agree to that.

24:52.750 --> 24:53.510
At that time,

24:53.830 --> 24:54.480
nothing can

24:54.480 --> 24:56.680
stop you from being with Physician Jiu.

24:58.720 --> 24:59.310
Xuanye,

24:59.750 --> 25:00.310
you're going

25:00.310 --> 25:01.570
to be Banxia's family.

25:05.680 --> 25:06.740
Don't refute that.

25:13.880 --> 25:14.440
Xuanye,

25:15.960 --> 25:17.610
I don't like that fellow of your father's.

25:17.610 --> 25:19.270
His vibes are not to my liking.

25:20.680 --> 25:21.340
What vibes?

25:22.700 --> 25:24.560
The kind that screams he hates me.

25:25.000 --> 25:27.060
He's been living here for a long time.

25:27.200 --> 25:28.710
I'm sure he takes a milder attitude

25:28.710 --> 25:30.110
towards demons than I do.

25:30.440 --> 25:31.040
Is that so?

25:45.310 --> 25:45.770
Xuanye,

25:46.070 --> 25:46.680
I just overheard

25:46.680 --> 25:47.940
Banxia and Tingzhou.

25:48.830 --> 25:50.670
When Banxia finds her father,

25:50.960 --> 25:52.310
she'll have her engagement cancelled

25:52.310 --> 25:53.570
and marry you instead.

25:54.150 --> 25:55.550
Just admit

25:55.590 --> 25:56.880
that you like her.

25:57.180 --> 25:58.840
Make a decision, you wobbler.

26:05.340 --> 26:05.850
Xuanye!

26:09.160 --> 26:10.290
Where are you going?

26:16.480 --> 26:18.020
It's been quite a while

26:18.680 --> 26:20.010
since you ran down here.

26:20.310 --> 26:21.770
You must be sleepy, right?

26:21.790 --> 26:23.240
You should go to bed now.

26:23.920 --> 26:24.830
I'm good.

26:25.400 --> 26:27.350
Are you having difficulty falling asleep?

26:27.350 --> 26:27.920
If so,

26:27.920 --> 26:29.180
I can keep you company.

26:29.640 --> 26:30.440
No need. No.

26:31.750 --> 26:32.870
I'm feeling sleepy now.

26:32.870 --> 26:34.330
I should go back to my room.

26:34.480 --> 26:35.200
Sit down!

26:48.550 --> 26:49.750
When have you

26:50.400 --> 26:51.510
become so bold?

26:55.240 --> 26:56.410
Well, I...

26:56.640 --> 26:57.880
I've been through

26:58.400 --> 26:59.600
many challenges now.

27:07.960 --> 27:08.550
Xuanye,

27:09.480 --> 27:11.550
if I were a demon,

27:13.880 --> 27:15.240
how would you treat me?

27:16.750 --> 27:18.350
Would you still be my friend?

27:19.270 --> 27:21.070
Would you pretend not to know me,

27:22.070 --> 27:23.550
or would you kill me?

27:25.090 --> 27:25.950
You're a human.

27:26.440 --> 27:28.410
That's not a reasonable hypothesis.

27:28.410 --> 27:29.810
How is it not reasonable?

27:29.830 --> 27:30.960
Just give me an answer.

27:30.960 --> 27:32.220
If I were a demon,

27:33.270 --> 27:34.600
would you try to kill me?

27:36.110 --> 27:37.270
Of course not.

27:40.030 --> 27:40.970
I would

27:40.990 --> 27:42.270
capture you

27:42.440 --> 27:43.240
and tie you up.

27:43.880 --> 27:44.880
You could keep me

27:44.880 --> 27:45.720
in the dark for so long

27:45.720 --> 27:47.120
without me realizing it.

27:47.270 --> 27:48.480
That means

27:48.510 --> 27:50.480
you're good at disguising yourself.

27:50.480 --> 27:51.510
You would be the kind

27:51.510 --> 27:53.570
of demon that has value for research.

27:59.830 --> 28:02.070
Even if you were a demon,

28:02.880 --> 28:04.310
I wouldn't mind.

28:27.500 --> 28:31.430
[Inn]

28:34.750 --> 28:35.440
Banxia,

28:36.440 --> 28:38.640
you seem to be in love with Xuanye.

28:39.310 --> 28:40.240
Do you know that?

29:13.740 --> 29:16.000
No one will come to your rescue this time.

29:16.920 --> 29:18.650
Let me see where else you can go.

29:36.220 --> 29:37.000
Look at this.

29:43.400 --> 29:44.480
Enlightenment Bookstore.

29:44.480 --> 29:46.110
We've finally found it.

29:46.590 --> 29:47.650
But it looks like

29:48.030 --> 29:49.110
a liquor store.

31:02.440 --> 31:03.920
Is there anything wrong with being a demon?

31:03.920 --> 31:05.110
Not every demon deserves death,

31:05.110 --> 31:07.370
not to mention the one that has helped me.

31:43.070 --> 31:44.640
Who are you?

31:45.790 --> 31:47.070
Why did you help me?

31:48.830 --> 31:49.830
You were attacked

31:50.190 --> 31:51.470
by two demon hunters.

31:53.920 --> 31:55.450
How did you figure that out?

31:56.160 --> 31:58.090
Why would they try to hunt you down?

32:00.960 --> 32:02.490
Demon hunters kill demons.

32:03.510 --> 32:05.200
Nothing unusual about it.

32:07.310 --> 32:09.710
You might have to hide yourself for a while.

32:11.590 --> 32:12.310
They

32:13.040 --> 32:14.630
know where my home is.

32:17.680 --> 32:18.940
Have you thought about

32:19.200 --> 32:20.930
leaving the Underground City?

32:24.920 --> 32:26.520
Given my current condition,

32:27.590 --> 32:30.000
I'll be dead if I leave here, won't I?

32:34.000 --> 32:35.400
Let me take you to a place.

32:36.200 --> 32:37.000
You may go now.

32:39.400 --> 32:40.510
Thank you, sir.

32:49.750 --> 32:50.380
Xuanye,

32:51.270 --> 32:53.370
do you know him?

32:54.590 --> 32:55.480
Barely.

32:56.160 --> 32:57.690
Then why would you help him?

32:57.750 --> 32:59.210
He has done nothing wrong.

32:59.240 --> 33:00.240
He shouldn't die.

33:02.200 --> 33:03.250
I thought

33:03.280 --> 33:05.160
after what happened to your parents,

33:05.160 --> 33:06.960
you would hate all demons' guts.

33:08.070 --> 33:09.670
I applaud for your attitude.

33:10.550 --> 33:11.900
If your father knew this,

33:11.900 --> 33:13.300
he would be very pleased.

33:13.640 --> 33:14.700
By the way, Xuanye,

33:15.750 --> 33:17.150
how is your search going?

33:17.240 --> 33:18.480
Have you found anything

33:18.480 --> 33:20.340
in the Enlightenment Bookstore?

33:20.790 --> 33:21.830
No, nothing.

33:22.480 --> 33:23.240
Be patient.

33:23.860 --> 33:25.140
I'll help you with it.

33:26.680 --> 33:27.680
Thank you, Uncle.

33:28.790 --> 33:29.550
Anytime.

33:30.310 --> 33:30.880
Try this.

33:30.900 --> 33:32.160
I made this tea for you.

33:32.790 --> 33:33.250
Come on.

33:34.110 --> 33:34.510
Sure.

33:38.920 --> 33:39.550
You'll

33:39.640 --> 33:41.140
find my paintings satisfactory.

33:41.140 --> 33:42.490
Girls like them.

33:42.570 --> 33:44.030
Good to see you again, sir.

33:48.070 --> 33:49.420
After all this walking,

33:50.560 --> 33:51.240
we still ended up

33:51.240 --> 33:52.500
on the Gallery Street.

33:53.400 --> 33:55.200
You shouldn't have bought this.

33:57.480 --> 33:59.210
Let's walk a bit further ahead.

34:13.550 --> 34:14.350
What is it now?

34:16.760 --> 34:18.420
Why is it telling us to go back?

34:18.800 --> 34:19.510
What kind of junk is this?

34:19.510 --> 34:20.590
It's not working at all.

34:20.590 --> 34:21.770
Seems odd.

34:23.630 --> 34:24.550
Silly gadget.

34:33.880 --> 34:35.610
Why does it keep pointing at me?

34:36.230 --> 34:38.489
Now you know you were scammed, don't you?

34:38.840 --> 34:39.500
Never mind.

34:40.560 --> 34:42.159
We should rely on ourselves.

34:42.909 --> 34:44.239
We're all on our own now.

34:44.280 --> 34:45.540
How should we proceed?

34:46.840 --> 34:47.510
Laws still apply to

34:47.510 --> 34:48.710
the Underground City

34:48.760 --> 34:49.710
The residents here dare not to

34:49.710 --> 34:50.760
openly defy the authorities.

34:50.760 --> 34:51.360
As usual,

34:51.400 --> 34:53.440
split up, tell them who we are and inquire.

34:53.440 --> 34:54.100
This gadget

34:54.510 --> 34:55.239
is yours now.

35:09.800 --> 35:10.660
Sima Lingying!

35:46.510 --> 35:47.370
Is anyone here?

35:59.550 --> 36:00.410
Is anyone here?

36:02.410 --> 36:03.070
Shop owner?

37:13.360 --> 37:14.000
Miss,

37:14.550 --> 37:15.610
you have a visitor.

37:16.190 --> 37:16.920
A visitor?

37:23.150 --> 37:24.590
Aren't you the owner of

37:24.590 --> 37:26.320
the Enlightenment Bookstore?

37:27.310 --> 37:28.760
You have such a good memory.

37:28.760 --> 37:29.510
Impressive.

37:29.530 --> 37:30.760
It's me, yes.

37:32.710 --> 37:33.370
Have a seat.

37:33.370 --> 37:34.500
Okay.

37:37.710 --> 37:39.590
What brings you here?

37:41.010 --> 37:43.070
Last time, after hearing your story,

37:43.720 --> 37:45.280
I felt deeply sorry for you.

37:46.450 --> 37:49.110
So, I asked my friends to collect information for me.

37:49.110 --> 37:50.710
Finally, there is a finding.

37:52.630 --> 37:53.560
I've figured out

37:53.960 --> 37:56.160
where the person you're looking for is.

38:00.120 --> 38:00.810
Take a look.

38:00.840 --> 38:02.570
See if this is his handwriting.

38:05.240 --> 38:07.700
It... It really is my father's handwriting.

38:09.110 --> 38:10.310
Then come with me now.

38:11.000 --> 38:11.880
Now?

38:12.030 --> 38:12.960
Yes.

38:13.880 --> 38:15.000
But my friends haven't

38:15.000 --> 38:16.110
come back yet.

38:18.590 --> 38:20.110
Don't miss out on this opportunity.

38:20.110 --> 38:21.360
Seize the time,

38:21.590 --> 38:23.450
or there might be another long wait

38:23.450 --> 38:25.310
before a second chance presents.

38:25.590 --> 38:26.330
In that case,

38:26.360 --> 38:27.280
I'm afraid you might never

38:27.280 --> 38:28.370
find the person.

38:34.150 --> 38:34.840
Miss,

38:36.780 --> 38:38.110
why are you hesitating?

38:41.880 --> 38:43.210
You've made a trip here.

38:43.760 --> 38:45.160
You should get some rest.

38:46.880 --> 38:47.840
I'm wondering

38:48.190 --> 38:49.590
where my father is now.

38:50.590 --> 38:51.800
Is my mother with him?

38:52.600 --> 38:53.480
I've had them stay

38:53.480 --> 38:54.310
at my shop now.

38:54.370 --> 38:55.450
We'd better go

38:55.480 --> 38:56.680
before it's too late.

38:57.360 --> 38:58.480
Let's go.

39:00.800 --> 39:01.880
At your shop?

39:02.760 --> 39:03.440
Miss,

39:04.440 --> 39:07.030
are you coming with me or not?

39:11.250 --> 39:11.690
Yes.

39:11.840 --> 39:12.280
Good.

39:12.920 --> 39:14.250
Let me get my coat.

39:14.280 --> 39:14.960
Sure.

39:15.230 --> 39:15.710
Go ahead.

39:15.710 --> 39:16.280
Do it now.

39:16.480 --> 39:17.880
I'll be waiting outside.

40:00.190 --> 40:00.770
Waiter!

40:01.150 --> 40:02.280
Miss, let's go now.

40:02.280 --> 40:03.480
The clock is ticking.

40:04.560 --> 40:05.120
But I...

40:11.880 --> 40:12.740
Let me through!

40:33.540 --> 40:35.190
Do you think you can run away?

40:50.070 --> 40:50.660
Banxia,

40:53.740 --> 40:54.670
we're coming in.

40:59.800 --> 41:00.860
-Banxia?
-Banxia?

41:26.440 --> 41:27.360
Physician Jiu?

41:27.750 --> 41:28.350
Tingzhou,

41:29.510 --> 41:30.770
isn't Banxia with you?

41:31.650 --> 41:32.290
